  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t0a3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t0a3) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 140.088 depth occurred on Jul 14 2026 12km NW of Santa Lucia De Pichigua. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.5779 longitude -71.4358. It impacted 132777 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
